          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Three Swiss requirements that German suppliers regularly miss — Planexus builds Zurich lab containers around them</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg mb-10 max-w-3xl">Generic landing pages for the whole of Germany do not address the three realities a lab container in Zurich must actually meet. We do — because we know the Swiss pharma, research and hospital market, and our Albstadt works produces what arrives here with Swiss paperwork.</p>
