              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Swiss permitting authorities do not accept DIN structural calculations on their own. SIA 261 with seismic zone Z1a (agd = 0.6 m/s²) and Bauwerksklasse I/II is binding. Containers from German works that document only DIN fail in the Zurich procedure and must be supplemented afterwards.</p>
