            <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border-l-4 border-primary">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">SIA 380/1 stricter than the GEG</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">SIA 380/1 (thermal energy in buildings) and MuKEn 2014/2025 require, for Swiss containers with six months or more of continuous operation, U-values ≤ 0.17 W/m²K (wall and roof), triple glazing with U ≤ 1.0 W/m²K and heat recovery with an efficiency of ≥ 75 per cent — stricter than the German GEG.</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-900 font-semibold pt-3 border-t border-gray-200">Planexus standard: sandwich envelope + triple glazing + heat recovery from the Albstadt works.</p>
